        "date": "2026-11-25T23:48:40Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(tools): ISO 13399 tool components, ISO 1832 and ISO 5608 codes, fit checks\n\nAdd the pure tool component model to camcraft-tools: the three ISO 13399\nkinds (cutting item, tool item, adaptive item), one normalized connection\ncode for both sides, the ISO 1832 insert code parser, the ISO 5608 holder\ncode parser with its insert seat, and the fit checks check_insert_fit and\ncheck_coupling_fit with the library queries compatible_parents and\ncompatible_children. Each mismatch is refused by name with both\ncomponents, the property, the expected and the actual value.\n\nFixes #3642\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
